  "title": "Ph Life Insurance Handbook — Standard Premium Guidelines:",
  "content": "### Standard Premium Guidelines:\n- **Payment Modes**: Monthly (via Auto-Debit Arrangement / ADA or post-dated checks), Quarterly, Semi-Annual, and Annual.\n- **Annual Premium Discount**: Policyholders selecting Annual payment receive an effective 8% discount compared to monthly installment equivalents.\n- **Sample Premiums (30-year-old Non-Smoker, ₱1,000,000 Coverage)**:\n  - SecureTerm (20-Year Term): ₱1,450 per month (₱16,000 annually).\n  - LifeHeritage (20-Pay Whole Life): ₱3,200 per month (₱35,000 annually).\n- **Grace Period**: All policies include a statutory 31-day grace period for payment of renewal premiums. The policy remains in full force during the grace period.\n\n---",
